# Cordova plugins for Capacitor
capacitor-cordova-ios-plugins

# Generated Config files
App/App/config.xml

# App/App/capacitor.config.json is tracked (not ignored) on purpose: its
# packageClassList array is the only place StreakBridgePlugin actually gets
# registered with the JS bridge, and `npx cap sync`/`cap copy` overwrites
# that array from scratch from an npm-plugin scan with no merge step, so it
# can't see a hand-written plugin like this one — see PROJECT_HANDOFF.md's
# "npx cap sync ios ... will silently un-register StreakBridgePlugin" note.
# Tracking this file means a `cap sync` regression shows up as a git diff
# to review/revert, instead of silently shipping with a broken widget.
